  "details": "<p>Ellibir is an unlocated fortress in the vicinity of Til-garimmu. E. Forrer identified it with the ruin mound of Halbur, which is on the road between Melitene and Sebasteia (approximately between <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Delikta\u015f,_Kangal\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Delikta\u1e63</a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kangal\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Kangal</a>).</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "A fortress in the vicinity of Til-garimmu fortified by the Assyrian king Sargon II (r. 721-705 BC) against Kasku.",
